# ─── Elecbits ODM PMS — environment ─────────────────────────────────────────
# All AI features degrade gracefully to offline parsers when nothing here is
# set, so the app runs with zero config. Set these to enable live Claude calls.
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in what you need (`.env` is git-ignored).

# RECOMMENDED — point the app at your own backend proxy that holds the API key
# server-side and forwards to the Anthropic Messages API. Keeps the key secret.
# VITE_CLAUDE_PROXY_URL=https://your-backend.example.com/api/claude

# LOCAL DEV ONLY — calling Anthropic directly from the browser exposes the key.
# Never ship this to production; use the proxy above instead.
# VITE_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# Model to use for all AI calls (scrum parsing, task verification, KPI scoring,
# designer-LLD generation). Defaults to claude-sonnet-4-5.
# VITE_CLAUDE_MODEL=claude-sonnet-4-5
